 \n(2 Big to Rig)   (2.2)\n𝟭𝗵𝟱𝟱\n\n𝗠𝘂𝘀𝗶𝗾𝘂𝗲
 \, 𝗗𝗼𝗰𝘂𝗺𝗲𝗻𝘁𝗮𝗶𝗿𝗲\nUnited States of Amer
 ica\, Mexico (English)\n\n𝗥𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀
  : Amir Juan Chamdin\, Jim Parsons\n𝗦𝗰𝗲𝗻𝗮𝗿𝗶𝗼 : Tob
 ias Forge\n𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻 : Fortress Entertainme
 nt Group\, Loma Vista Productions\, Trafalgar Releasing\n\n𝗔𝗰𝘁
 𝗲𝘂𝗿𝘀 :\n- Tobias Forge\n- Per Eriksson\n- Cosmo Sniderman\n- H
 ayden C Scott\n- Laura Scarborough\n- Olivia Morreale\n- Randy Moore\n- Ga
 briela Gunčíková\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit sur TMDB)\nCaptured 
 live over the course of GHOST’s two sold-out shows in Mexico City last y
 ear\, 2 BIG TO RIG is the definitive document of the band's unforgettable 
 SKELETOUR WORLD TOUR\, presented in IMAX® in select locations.  Featuring
  the only pro-shot footage of Papa V Perpetua and his band of Nameless Gho
 uls from the phone-free SKELETOUR\, 2 BIG TO RIG immerses the audience in 
 the GHOST live ritual\, including exclusive behind-the-scenes and backstag
 e access.\n\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1693400\n\nDo
 nnées fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB)
